{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"基础：把「隐状态序列」这件事说清楚","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/hidden-markov-models/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"why-hmm","title":"为何隐马尔可夫模型：给看不见的状态序列一个模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/hidden-markov-models/foundations/why-hmm","wordCount":1899,"readingTime":8},{"seq":2,"slug":"markov-assumption","title":"马尔可夫假设与隐状态：HMM 的形式定义","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/hidden-markov-models/foundations/markov-assumption","wordCount":1693,"readingTime":7},{"seq":3,"slug":"three-problems","title":"三大问题：Rabiner 框架下的 HMM 全景","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/hidden-markov-models/foundations/three-problems","wordCount":1501,"readingTime":7}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"基础-把-隐状态序列-这件事说清楚\">基础：把「隐状态序列」这件事说清楚</h1><p>在写下任何递推公式之前，得先回答三个更根本的问题：为什么普通的分类器或回归模型处理不了这类数据？「马尔可夫假设」到底约束了什么、又放过了什么？以及，一个 HMM 摆在面前时，我们究竟想拿它算什么？</p>\n<p>这一章按这个顺序展开。第一篇从动机入手，用语音、生信、金融几个例子说明「观测可见、状态隐藏、状态按链演化」这一结构为什么普遍，以及为它专门建模的价值。第二篇给出形式定义：马尔可夫性、隐状态空间、转移矩阵 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span>、发射矩阵 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span>、初始分布 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>π</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pi</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span></span></span></span></span>，并写出联合概率的因子分解——这是后面所有算法的公理起点。第三篇引入 Rabiner 1989 年综述里的经典三分法，把 HMM 的全部用途归纳为评估、解码、学习三个问题，为推断章与学习章搭好路标。</p>\n<p>读完这一章，你不会算任何具体的前向概率，但你会知道每个符号代表什么、三大问题各自问的是什么。这是进入<a href=\"../inference/\">推断章</a>的唯一前提。</p>\n"}